  "comment": {
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Joshua Allan Westgard",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Abfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I will need clarification on the difference between this and \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2166\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2166\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Dataset: Create objects with cross-object relationships\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2166\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n.  The current dataset (when all the relationships are correctly built) includes a patent (pcdm:Object) and a single PDF (pcdm:File) for each patent.  These are related objects, but I'm unclear on the intended difference between cross-object relationship and nesting.  Is the idea to have direct containment?  If that is what is meant by nesting we may need to add some different data for that.</p>",
     "created": "02/Sep/16 4:10 PM",
     "id": "17363",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12090/comment/17363",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/JW-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Joshua Allan Westgard",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Abfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "02/Sep/16 4:10 PM"
    },
    {
