      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Thanks, I will work on the other two for now then.  If in the meantime nobody else has data that is more naturally nestable, I'm sure there is a way to nest some of this that would still make for a sensible dataset (i.e. meaningfully queryable by anyone using the data for testing in the future).</p>",
